N2R contains lifecycle and generic expertise logic adapted from N2 Daebung.
The MIT notice for that code is retained in LICENSE.

n2-clotho provides the .n2 parser and bundled WASM compiler.
Its distribution terms are retained in LICENSE-CLOTHO and LICENSE-APACHE.
Its own package also carries the MIT notice for adapted Daebung code.
Source https://github.com/choihyunsus/n2-clotho

n2-mimir provides the common Soul SQLite schema and storage connection.
Its distribution terms are retained in LICENSE-MIMIR and LICENSE-MIMIR-APACHE.
Its own package includes additional upstream notices.
Source https://github.com/choihyunsus/n2-mimir

n2-personas provides the 72 generic role prompts and catalog.
Its MIT license is retained in LICENSE-PERSONAS.
Source https://github.com/choihyunsus/n2-personas

Additional runtime dependencies retain the license files distributed in their
installed packages. Review each dependency's terms for your intended use.
